(1)    1/    194C :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
(1)    2/    194C :                     ; New format based on Kosinski. It changes several design decisions to allow
(1)    3/    194C :                     ; a faster decompressor without loss of compression ratio.
(1)    4/    194C :                     ; Created originally by Flamewing and vladikcomper (by discussions on IRC),
(1)    5/    194C :                     ; further improvements by Clownacy.
