    5231/    8CF4 :                     		; zone scrolls entire blocks of lines (16 lines) at once. The scroll
    5232/    8CF4 :                     		; value of each row is written to 'TempArray_LayerDef', before it is
    5233/    8CF4 :                     		; applied to 'Horiz_Scroll_Buf' in 'Deform_HPZ_Continued'. This is
    5234/    8CF4 :                     		; vaguely similar to how Chemical Plant Zone scrolls its background,
    5235/    8CF4 :                     		; even overflowing 'Horiz_Scroll_Buf' in the same way.
