(1)   53/   A443E :                     ; DANGER! several songs will use the first few bytes of MusicIndex as their main
(1)   54/   A443E :                     ; tempos while speed shoes are active. If you don't want that, you should add
(1)   55/   A443E :                     ; their "correct" sped-up main tempos to the list.
