(1) 1910/   A539A :                     ; PSG Note Values: c-1 to a-6
(1) 1911/   A539A :                     ;
(1) 1912/   A539A :                     ; Each row is an octave, starting with C and ending with B. Sonic 3's driver
(1) 1913/   A539A :                     ; adds another octave at the start, as well as two more notes and the end to
(1) 1914/   A539A :                     ; complete the last octave. Notably, a-6 is changed from 0 to $10. These
(1) 1915/   A539A :                     ; changes need to be applied here in order for ports of songs from Sonic 3
(1) 1916/   A539A :                     ; and later to sound correct.
(1) 1917/   A539A :                     ;
(1) 1918/   A539A :                     ; Here is what Sonic 3's version of this table looks like:
(1) 1919/   A539A :                     ;		dc.w $3FF, $3FF, $3FF, $3FF, $3FF, $3FF, $3FF, $3FF, $3FF, $3F7, $3BE, $388
