(2)  520/   A6FA4 :                     
(2)  521/   A6FA4 :                     ; Stops special SFX (S1 only) and restarts overridden music track
(2)  522/   A6FA4 :                     smpsStopSpecial macro
(2)  523/   A6FA4 :                     	if SonicDriverVer==1
