(2)   13/   A9DBA :                                     ; In SMPS 68k Type 1, this byte is skipped and can contain garbage.
(2)   13/   A9DBA :                                     ; Sonic 2's Oil Ocean Zone and Ending themes set this byte to a non-zero value which
